gao2(){return'Maybe you noticed the green boxes above each crate? These are the placement codes. Each crate gets a short, unique code like "A-1-B". \n \n The code consists of the parents placement code, plus a layer-unique segment for the crate itself. Together they form a unique identifier for each crate that tells you it\'s location in the hierarchy. \n\nJust follow the code \u2728'},
